{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0324_1000_p", "source_sha256": "412ea9c47dbf432a401b40b1bbd32ddf9fd002ba6e42eca968f378ffa3eb72a4", "ja": "（今日から可奈とやよいの新番組の収録だ。\nなかなか攻めた番組だけど、ふたりは大丈夫かな？）", "zh": "（从今天开始录制可奈和弥生的新节目。节目内容相当大胆，不知道她们两个能不能应付得来？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0324_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "39aac5b53156af273cd1d33a249aea70f58b4bd9cf955b9a1e6b91fdce40649d", "ja": "えーっと、今回は『大人向けの子ども番組』……\nあれ？　大人向けなのに子どもの番組なんだね……？", "zh": "呃，这次是“面向大人的儿童节目”……\n咦？明明是面向大人的，却是儿童节目呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0324_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "69c173cdc5a09aea855d611e0abd09ffb8582f3e95ca88b0f3378dfdf2a6ab99", "ja": "『いたずら妖精が、疲れた大人の子ども心を取り戻す』\nって書いてるし、見るのは大人の人……？", "zh": "上面写着“淘气小精灵让疲惫的大人找回童心”，所以观看的都是大人……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0324_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d63f90d30dcbf6c78872b8b9a180c074f22cc5e32362e22d02a256fbf3057e39", "ja": "ああ、そうだよ。番組を観ている大人たちが、\n子どもみたいに楽しめるような番組、ってことらしい。", "zh": "啊，是这样。也就是说，这是一个能让观看节目的大人们像孩子一样享受其中的节目。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0324_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "0dd79b76fbdf372ddde7893f76d4e4315b61feffa020b925a3c664a8318b0e1e", "ja": "なるほど～！　大人の人が楽しむ番組か……。\nなら、あんまり子どもっぽくない方がいいですよね？", "zh": "原来如此～！是让大人享受的节目啊……那还是别太孩子气比较好，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0324_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "430977f352b3a0cfc0e2dde2ded55009c7210ccbe7f6316ace0346c22669b1ea", "ja": "そうかも……大人は子どもみたいに遊ばないもんね。\nでも、子ども番組なんだよね……うーん？", "zh": "可能是吧……大人不会像小孩子那样玩呢。\n不过，这是儿童节目吧……嗯——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0324_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7024f3e0f0b33795bff278dd9a78e16e02972a37703e5eedc813bc817dd0a4e6", "ja": "難しく考えなくて大丈夫。大人でも、子どもみたいに\n遊びたいと思ってる人はたくさんいるんだ。", "zh": "不用想得太复杂，没关系的。就算是大人，\n也有很多人想像孩子一样玩耍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0324_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "c27333a68956f6781d849e38e0a85fdb14d958eff9b3c2167a163447349005d9", "ja": "えー、そうなんですか！？　このみさんや莉緒さんも？\nもしかして、{$P$}さんも……！？", "zh": "诶——是这样吗！？　连木下姐姐和莉绪姐姐也是？\n难道说，{$P$}先生也……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0324_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c3fa0a3ca8e6e761fdd9b6fec25074f411f0f3df01d6c6c518c3ff10fc80d5a1", "ja": "えっ！？　……まあ、そういう時もあるかな。\nでもみんな、大人だから普段は我慢してるんだ。", "zh": "诶！？……嗯，也会有这种时候吧。\n不过大家都是成年人，平时都会忍住的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0324_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "faee9ae79737001613db265f651dded998e304f2470f563d7bd0df0174050bae", "ja": "そっかー！　わかりました、{$P$}！\n我慢している人に、私たちがいたずらするんですね！", "zh": "原来如此！明白了，{$P$}！\n也就是说，我们要对那些一直忍耐的人恶作剧呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0324_1010_005yay", "source_sha256": "a1ca05d685ebeeb40202a7b327eac4d063ec396fe63a094d4812486176870d24", "ja": "「朝までゲームしちゃおー♪」とか\n「好きなだけおやつ食べちゃえー！」って！", "zh": "像是“玩游戏玩到天亮吧～♪”\n或是“想吃多少零食就吃多少吧～！”这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0324_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9e99a7e2c4fd758d7966b5e9bac992298fab2f8da1875e3e91d06db8023af9b3", "ja": "その通りだ！　真面目な大人たちを誘惑するのが\n可奈とやよい……いたずら妖精の仕事だな！", "zh": "就是这样！诱惑一本正经的大人们，就是可奈和弥生……恶作剧小精灵的工作啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0324_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "ac378b002a452e604b6e829dcb1106586ae0f5ee995758d5f79ed5c67122a9bf", "ja": "わぁ～。やよいちゃんと{$P$}さんの\nおかげで、すっごくイメージが湧いてきました！", "zh": "哇～。多亏了弥生和{$P$}先生，\n我现在非常有画面感了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0324_1013_p", "source_sha256": "0b2c79bd1e286a7406ceadb98be70a357de9452ab02399eb5139836f264f21b7", "ja": "それはよかった！\nじゃあ、本番前にちょっと確認を……。", "zh": "那太好了！\n那么，正式开始前先稍微确认一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0324_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "c3c0a7a33d02cb7947c9376c4f5b5550d3a468a521970f480c7758fb6cf9b406", "ja": "誘惑かぁ～。私、面白いマンガとか、おいしそうな\nお菓子とかあると……ついつい、気になっちゃって。", "zh": "诱惑啊～。我一看到有趣的漫画，或者美味的点心之类的……就会不由得在意起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0324_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "aa0091ccc676e884ecbea8fe74cf2b721ef7ca0febf3c60c0307cede86d7607c", "ja": "可奈ちゃんも？　私も、お腹が空いてる時に\nお買い物してると、あれもこれも～って……。", "zh": "可奈也会吗？我也是，肚子饿的时候买东西，就会想着这个也想要、那个也想要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0324_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a7fdc44e51aa1d92954d602fae5041ccec4cb391c50161fe4e818bd571b7577d", "ja": "えっと、確認を……って、おーい、聞いてるか？", "zh": "呃，我确认一下……喂——你有在听吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0324_1017_005yay", "source_sha256": "4a6c745fc7a61993bf1e8ecbcde69137ac7683dea2d210122ebaca25d2caca9d", "ja": "あと……弟たちが子ども番組見てるときも気に\nなっちゃうかも！　体操とか、歌のコーナーとか。", "zh": "还有……弟弟们看少儿节目的时候，我可能也\n会在意起来！比如做体操啊，唱歌的环节之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0324_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "531b157be0f0ff5e35484b3a21d802681d52565a6439482c690a4da7cadae179", "ja": "あ、お料理の時は、ちょっと困っちゃうかなーって。\n音楽にあわせて、つい体が動いちゃって……えへへ♪", "zh": "啊，说到做饭的时候，可能会有点困扰呢——\n身体会不由自主地随着音乐动起来……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0324_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "a27e700a4ed99753b0dc553d0e1b57cca431c393626a817f622982c0a5e7c1c1", "ja": "わかるわかる！　私も一緒に歌ったりするよ！\nいたずら妖精の誘惑だ～♪　番組の収録ワクワクだ～♪", "zh": "懂的懂的！我也会跟着一起唱哦！\n调皮小妖精的诱惑呀～♪　节目录制好期待呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0324_1020_p", "source_sha256": "1a3fbe1b9470858d8f02459e7cb76920f943cf60a3aa412cc3d4567d07300d9a", "ja": "（ふたりが楽しみながら収録した番組の放送後……\n視聴者の間で、斬新で面白いと評判になった！）", "zh": "（节目播出后……两人一边享受录制过程，一边完成的节目在观众间获得了“新颖又有趣”的好评！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
